          top             profile (40 px, centred on y 43 like the pill) at the left; at the right clock, wifi and battery in the order of the Switch 2 home, inside a pill (x 400..617, y 27..59; the
                          clock is right-aligned at x 499, so 12 h and 24 h both fit)
          system screen   name of the selected system y 116..140; tiles 124 px, pitch 140 (the selected one at x 40..164, y 150..274, same size as the others, the ring
                          134 px around it); the carousel box is wider than the screen on both sides (x -200 .. 1200 = 10 slots of 140) so only the screen's
                          edge cuts the row; logoPos puts the selected tile's left edge at x 40 (240 from the box's left). Dock: pill x 65..575, y 318..378
          game list       column of banners x 24..138 (5 cells of 114 x 64, gap 8, y 68..420), the selected one the middle one, same size, with its ring (122 x 72);
                          the card of the game's image at the right (x 200..617, y 68..296, filled by the image: cover + the mask frame.png), then the system, the name and three rows of data (y 354..420)
          bottom          console icon at the left, button legend (footer-enabled.xml) at y 0.895 -->
